id: pm-gh1457
title: "GH-1457: Recover output cursors passed to --after and expose budget continuation controls"
description: "Investigate and correct reported continuation-kind confusion: budget next_cursor passed to documented --after is rejected without executable --output-cursor recovery, while help hides the consuming flag. Include the same report’s --no-truncate plus explicit --limit behavior."
