  "2026-10-14T04:36:55.106Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: the new isolated CLI keeper fails before changes because list help hides --output-cursor. After correction, it executes wrong-kind refusal recovery across list/search/context and tests complete reads, explicit row caps and explicit token ceilings. A real boundary exposed the previous no-truncate plus limit implementation ignored row caps; resolve explicit producer limits first and disable only the implicit default token ceiling. Keep existing composed continuation, semantic cursor fingerprint and stale-snapshot guards."
